Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?HTDESIGNER-35:=20=E5=85=A8=E9=83=A8=E6=94=B9?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=9B=9E=20--=20one=20pattern=20of=20the=20DFM=20difference=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?list=20back=20to=20the=20DFM=20in=20one=20step=20(0.35.0)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The DFM difference list folds "the same difference on many controls" into
one pattern line. A look / caption pattern line now has a 全部改回 button:
it asks once, then every control of that pattern gets the DFM value back
in ONE source edit, so one Ctrl+Z takes all of them back. Position / size
patterns get no button (each control has its own DFM value there).

- probe: lookChange / captionChange split out of setLook / setCaption;
  new message editMany -> one batch edit
- host: DfmDiffPanel.resetPattern (modal confirm; tests pass confirmed)
- dfmdiff panel: the button, only on non-layout pattern lines
- tests: probe (one batch for 2 controls), smoke (a bold pattern of 7
  labels -> editMany of 7; a position pattern -> nothing), panels_render
  (the button posts resetPattern:<key>, none on position lines), real
  VS Code (Setup.Speed TPanel Color x36 written, ONE undo back, no save)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
